WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:10.050
Part nineteen: fix a name or a code. On a volunteer's admin page, you can fix their name, email them their code, or give them a new one.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:13.439
Look up the volunteer. That's part two.

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:17.190
Below their details is More for this volunteer.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:23.353
Fix their name: first and last as on their ID, and what they go by. Tap Save the name.

00:00:23.553 --> 00:00:30.350
Their Drive folder and files are renamed too, and the old name is kept, so searches still find them.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:37.451
Email them their code sends it to the email on file. Same limits as when they ask for it themselves.

00:00:37.651 --> 00:00:45.119
Give them a new code if someone else got hold of theirs. Their old code and links stop working right away. It takes a second tap.

00:00:45.319 --> 00:00:48.590
Leave the box checked to email them the new code.
